An *Euler continued fraction* is a generalized continued fraction of the form
$$
  h + \cfrac{\rho_0}
            {1 - \cfrac{\rho_1}
                       {1 + \rho_1 - \cfrac{\rho_2}
                                           {1 + \rho_2 - \cfrac{\rho_3}
                                                               {1 + \rho_3 - \dots}}}}
$$
